I just ascended a wiz.  This thread just happened a few days ago but here
was my strategy.  Use Your Pet, and make as many pets as possible.  If you
happen to get Charm Monster spell you're set.  Add a magic whistle, use a
tin one until you can get one.  Use Force Bolt when necessary.  Keep your XP
as low as possible until you get some decent armor.  For a wizard that
amounts to crystal plate mail or dragon scales if you happen to gain a wish.
In the case of the first example your strength will need to be exercised, so
work on that.

Collect as much food as possible and eat all critters you can.  That goes
for most classes really.  Exercising your strengh is easy but costs you
hunger.  The main spells I use are attack, especially magic missile; healing
and divination spells make the game a lot easier (identify, mapping). Remove
Curse is most useful.  But these are mid-game strategies not early.

Once you get some armor, magic bane and advance in some key spells you are
practially unstoppable.

